We're ready to preset you a new big update!
What's new:
Absolute new and more challenging levels;
Some environment objects can be destroyed now;
New game balance.

List of changes:
* Now the game works in full screen mode;
* Changed the balance in favor of the player;
* Add "Cheat code";

We apologize for the delay. There were some technical difficulties. Hope for understanding. :(

